{"step_index":1019,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-10T21:16:22Z","input_tokens":4457,"cache_read_tokens":453397,"output_tokens":765,"content":"I have prepared the [implementation plan](file:///C:/Users/CxAdmin/.gemini/antigravity/brain/8f2bd4b5-d81b-4839-aa40-a5c3a5acaa6a/implementation_plan.md) to add a teacher reset control for the `\"You have already responded\"` lock screen across both local and remote student devices:\n\n### Summary of Proposed Plan\n1. **Add `Reset Response Lock` Button ([teacher.html](file:///c:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/teacher.html))**:\n   - Place **`Reset Response Lock`** in the main **Teacher Quiz Manager** card beside `Save to Quiz` and `Download Quiz File` (so it stays accessible even when Auto Record Quiz is `OFF`).\n   - Reuse the centered confirmation modal (`\"Are you sure this is what you want?\"` -> **Yes** / **No**) so it cannot be triggered accidentally.\n   - Confirming **Yes** updates only `lockEpoch` (`Date.now()`) on Firestore `quizzes/{quizId}` via `updateMask.fieldPaths=lockEpoch` (leaving unsaved draft questions untouched) and removes the lock locally on the teacher's browser as well.\n   - Preserve `currentLockEpoch` on regular **Save to Quiz** edits so editing a typo does not unlock already-completed students.\n2. **Automatic Cross-Device Unlock ([index.html](file:///c:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/index.html))**:\n   - Save the active `epoch` (`quizData.lockEpoch || 0`) inside `localStorage` when starting and finishing the quiz.\n   - On page load (`checkRemoteUnlock`), whenever `remote.lockEpoch > local.epoch`, automatically clear `\"You have already responded\"` (`localStorage.removeItem(LOCK)`), hide `#lock`, and open the quiz again; otherwise keep `#lock` enforced.\n3. **Re-Harden, Sync & Changelog**:\n   - Re-apply the two-layer AST obfuscation + RC4 stream-cipher hardening to [index.html](file:///c:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/index.html) and [teacher.html](file:///c:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/teacher.html), re-sync `quizzes/template` to Firestore, run full live epoch unlock verification, and append **Non-Major Patch 1.0.21** to [HISTORY.md](file:///c:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/HISTORY.md).\n\nPlease review the [implementation plan](file:///C:/Users/CxAdmin/.gemini/antigravity/brain/8f2bd4b5-d81b-4839-aa40-a5c3a5acaa6a/implementation_plan.md) and reply with **\"proceed\"** (or click the Proceed button) to implement this feature."}
